      <dd><p sourcefile="api/GameFramework.Services.Interfaces.IGameDataService.yml" sourcestartlinenumber="2" sourceendlinenumber="2">Clean IGameDataService interface for unified GameSession management</p>
</dd>
    </dl>
    <dl class="jumplist">
      <dt><a class="xref" href="GameFramework.Services.Interfaces.IGameService.html">IGameService</a></dt>
      <dd><p sourcefile="api/GameFramework.Services.Interfaces.IGameService.yml" sourcestartlinenumber="2" sourceendlinenumber="2">Base interface for all game services that can be initialized and shut down</p>
</dd>
    </dl>
    <dl class="jumplist">
      <dt><a class="xref" href="GameFramework.Services.Interfaces.ILoadService.html">ILoadService</a></dt>
      <dd><p sourcefile="api/GameFramework.Services.Interfaces.ILoadService.yml" sourcestartlinenumber="2" sourceendlinenumber="3">Service responsible for orchestrating all game loading operations
Handles the business logic of loading games, creating sessions, and managing state transitions</p>
</dd>
    </dl>
