</dd>
    </dl>
    <dl class="jumplist">
      <dt><a class="xref" href="GameFramework.Services.Interfaces.ISaveService.html">ISaveService</a></dt>
      <dd><p sourcefile="api/GameFramework.Services.Interfaces.ISaveService.yml" sourcestartlinenumber="2" sourceendlinenumber="4">Interface for save service that handles both file operations and business logic
Provides clean separation between low-level file I/O and high-level save operations
Supports both regular saves and autosaves with automatic file management</p>
</dd>
    </dl>
