      <dd><p sourcefile="api/GameFramework.Services.Interfaces.ITimeService.yml" sourcestartlinenumber="2" sourceendlinenumber="3">Interface for time tracking service that manages game time, session time, and level time
with proper pause handling and state awareness</p>
</dd>
